[Round "-"]
[White "Illustration"]
[Black "Illustration"]
[Result "*"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "7k/7p/8/8/P7/8/R7/K7 w - - 0 1"]

1. Ra3 { The rook moves one square up the file. Its own pawn is immediately in front of it. } 1... h6 { Black advances the h-pawn; this does not remove White’s obstruction. } 2. Rg3 { The rook uses the third rank instead. A blocked file does not prevent movement along a clear rank. } *

[Event "Chess, Clearly: lesson 3"]
[Site "https://knightway8.github.io/chess15/lessons/03-a-bishop-always-keeps-its-square-color.html"]
[Date "2026.09.05"]
