[Black "Illustration"]
[Result "*"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "7k/7p/8/8/8/8/3P4/K1B5 w - - 0 1"]

1. Ba3 { The bishop follows c1–b2–a3. All three squares have the same color. } 1... h6 { Black’s pawn move leaves the bishop’s route unchanged. } 2. Bc5 { From a3, the bishop travels through b4 to c5, again remaining on dark squares. } *

[Event "Chess, Clearly: lesson 4"]
[Site "https://knightway8.github.io/chess15/lessons/04-a-knight-jumps-then-lands.html"]
