[Black "Illustration"]
[Result "*"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "7k/7p/8/8/3N4/8/8/K7 w - - 0 1"]

1. Nf5 { The knight jumps from d4 to f5. It does not pass through e4 or f4. } 1... h6 { Black advances a pawn on the opposite wing. } 2. Nd6 { From f5, the knight jumps to d6. Its next set of destinations is measured from this new square. } *

[Event "Chess, Clearly: lesson 5"]
[Site "https://knightway8.github.io/chess15/lessons/05-pawns-move-one-way-and-capture-another.html"]
