[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "7k/8/8/3pp3/4P3/8/8/K7 w - - 0 1"]

1. exd5 { White’s e-pawn captures on d5. The e records the pawn’s original file, and x records a capture. } 1... e4 { The Black e5 pawn advances to the now-empty e4 square. } 2. d6 { White’s pawn, now on the d-file, advances straight ahead to d6. } *

