[Result "*"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "4r2k/8/8/8/8/8/2P5/4KB2 w - - 0 1"]

1. Be2 { The bishop blocks the e-file. White is no longer in check. } 1... Rxe2+ { If Black exchanges the rook for the bishop, the rook now checks from e2. } 2. Kxe2 { White’s king captures the rook. In this position, e2 has no remaining Black defender. } *

