[Date "2026.09.05"]
[Round "-"]
[White "Illustration"]
[Black "Illustration"]
[Result "*"]
[SetUp "1"]
[FEN "7k/8/4p3/3r4/8/8/6B1/3R2K1 w - - 0 1"]

1. Rxd5 { White takes the Black rook. This is only the first step of the exchange. } 1... exd5 { Black recaptures with the e6 pawn, removing White’s rook. } 2. Bxd5 { White’s bishop takes that pawn, completing the illustrated exchange. } *
